sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Board as Board page (useMessages)
    participant API as GraphQL API
    participant Svc as MessageService
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant PubSub
    participant Sub as Subscribed clients (useSubscription)

    User->>Board: write message, click Send
    note over Board: empty content → alert, no request<br/>over 500 chars → BAD_USER_INPUT
    Board->>API: mutation createMessage(userId, content)
    API->>Svc: create(userId, content)
    Svc->>DB: user exists?
    alt user not found
        Svc-->>API: GraphQLError (NOT_FOUND)
        API-->>Board: errors → alert("User not found")
    end
    Svc->>DB: INSERT INTO messages
    DB-->>Svc: saved message
    Svc->>PubSub: publish("messageAdded", message)
    PubSub-->>Sub: messageAdded (WebSocket)
    Sub->>API: refetch getMessages(current page)
    Svc-->>API: Message
    API-->>Board: { id, content, userId, user { email } }
    Board->>API: refetch getMessages(page=1, limit=10)
    API->>Svc: findAll(1, 10)
    Svc->>DB: SELECT messages ORDER BY created_at DESC, id DESC
    API-->>Board: paginated items

    note over Board,API: Message.user is resolved via UserLoader (DataLoader),<br/>batching all author lookups for the page into one query
